# RESETIUS | Weave {
# RESETIUS |   Angle 4
# RESETIUS |   Axiom z
# RESETIUS |   z=x
# RESETIUS |   x=--g+g+@7f@i7+g+g++x+--g-g-@7f@i7-g-g++y
# RESETIUS |   y=--g+g+@7f@i7+g+g++x---g-g-@7f@i7-g-g++y
# RESETIUS |   f=
# RESETIUS |   g=
# RESETIUS |   }
